WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.079
-I want to talk about
your new movie,

00:00:02.079 --> 00:00:04.504
"Spiral: From the Book of Saw,"

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.439
the number-1 movie over
the weekend.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.775
-Thank you.
-Not too shabby. Number-1 movie.

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:11.410
-Not too shabby.
-I'll take number 1.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.579
-I'll take it.
-I'll take number 1.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:13.779
-Yeah.

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:15.615
-Dude, Chris,
let me talk to you about this.

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.450
-Scary, man.
-Frightening scary.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.886
-Frightening!
-I mean, but then --

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:21.554
-You know what the scariest
movie I ever saw?

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.356
-What?
-"Fatal Attraction."

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:26.959
-Yes.
But I would say that really is.

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:30.329
-That's the real scary.

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.665
Ain't nothing scarier
than your woman finding out.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.268
-Yeah.

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:42.842
-Goblins or vampires --
who gives a [bleep]

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:46.579
A mad woman?
Now, that is scary.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.814
That'll make it hard to sleep.

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:52.919
-I'm watching the movie,
and it's honestly

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:55.922
some of the most
craziest stuff I've ever seen.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.790
I'm just like, "What?!"

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.292
And then I heard that
you thought of this idea.

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:02.095
-I did.
You know what's weird?

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:05.198
I was at Guy Oseary's wedding,
and --

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:07.299
-That's where you thought
of the movie?

00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:09.201
-I was at Guy Oseary's wedding.

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:12.238
Guy Oseary got married
in Brazil by the Jesus.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.372
-Of course he did.

00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:15.308
-And Madonna is there
and Bono is there.

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:17.510
Like, everybody is there
and all this and that, right?

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:21.514
And the head of Lionsgate was,
like, was kind of --

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:22.882
maybe not this far away.

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:24.951
But -- And --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:27.419
-That would be unnatural.
-Yeah, that would be unnatural.

00:01:27.419 --> 00:01:29.722
And, you know, so, I'm like,
"Oh, I know this guy --

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:30.756
the head of Lionsgate."

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:33.059
I was like,
"Oh, you guys have 'Saw.'

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:35.161
You ever thought about
having some humor in it?

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.129
Just a little bit, you know?"

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:39.865
-Yeah, just one --
-Just a --

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:41.701
-One joke?

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:43.603
-And he thought
it was a good idea.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.404
And he called me in,
and we had this meeting

00:01:45.404 --> 00:01:46.438
like three weeks later.

00:01:46.438 --> 00:01:47.573
And next thing I know,

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:49.208
I'm shooting a movie, like,
that summer.

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:51.877
-That's crazy.
-We got Sam Jackson in there.

00:01:51.877 --> 00:01:54.380
-I love Sam Jackson.
-Who doesn't love Sam Jackson?

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.149
-What's he like to act with?

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:59.752
-He is -- You know, people
always go, "How did you get Sam?

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:01.120
He did you a favor."

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:04.523
"No, we got Sam a check, okay?

00:02:04.523 --> 00:02:05.758
-If you pay Samuel L. --

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:08.962
-If you pay Sam Jackson,
he will show up, okay?

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:13.165
But if Sam is your neighbor
and you try to borrow a rake,

00:02:13.165 --> 00:02:14.934
it'll cost you $1,000.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.636
-Yeah. But you can
get the rake if you want.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.305
-You can get the rake,
but it's gonna cost you.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.674
So --
-He plays your dad.

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:24.243
-Yeah, he played my dad,
and it was great.

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:25.611
He's kind of method,

00:02:25.611 --> 00:02:28.147
so he insisted on sleeping
with my mother, which was --

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:31.583
-That's not true.
That is not true at all.

00:02:31.583 --> 00:02:33.819
-It was a little uncomfortable.

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:38.258
It was a little uncomfortable.
But she didn't mind.

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:42.895
-Alright. But did you -- Should
we set this up in any way?

00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:43.897
-Just set it up.

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:44.897
-I want to show everyone a clip,

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:46.332
but I don't want too show much.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.866
-Don't show too much, Jimmy.

00:02:47.866 --> 00:02:49.869
Don't give away
the whole movie, Jimmy.

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.403
-There's handcuffs involved.

00:02:51.403 --> 00:02:53.172
-There's stuff involved.

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:55.674
-Yeah, you'll see
what's about to happen.

00:02:55.674 --> 00:02:57.009
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:02:57.009 --> 00:03:00.546
Here's Chris Rock in
"Spiral: From the Book of Saw,"

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:01.547
number-1 movie.

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:02.749
Take a look.

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:05.217
-[ Groans ]

00:03:05.217 --> 00:03:07.820
♪♪

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:08.955
-You okay?

00:03:12.191 --> 00:03:13.359
Hey.

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:21.868
Help!

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:45.758
-That's scary.

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.494
-Unbelievably well-done, bud.
Congrats on that.

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.796
-Thank you.
-And I appreciate -- Chris Rock.

00:03:50.796 --> 00:03:54.434
"Spiral: From the Book of Saw"
is in theaters now!

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:55.435
-Thank you!

